 saul goodman is  a total success and has been a  standalone part of the franchise  alongside the main series for years as  has now been announced on twitter there  will be a much anticipated reunion with  walter white jesse pinkman and saul in  time for the final season of better  called saul the official twitter account  of the series recently revealed this by  posting a photo of the two stars of the  original series it is currently unknown  in what form brian cranston and aaron  paul will celebrate the reunion however  it seems logical to assume that the  first meeting of the odd trio at the  beginning of breaking bad will be  revisited we will find out more when the  sixth season of batter called salt  premieres on april 18th and july 11 2022  as the season will be released in two  parts  what would the jurassic park and  jurassic world movies ever be without  the giant scary dinosaurs in the first  jurassic world it was the indominus rex  that spread fear and terror and in this  sequel it was this somewhat smaller in  the raptor that caused some auction  guests to have a wrecked evening  needless to say jurassic world dominion  will be no exception and will also  introduce a new movie favorite on the  side of the dinosaurs the big change is  that this time it won't be a hybrid  creature but a real dinosaur that  actually existed we are talking about  the gigantic  giganotosaurus that can be seen in a new  image from empire magazine like the  t-rex this dinosaur is a giant carnival  with an estimated length of up to 43  feet it is also believed to be even more  frightening in appearance than the t-rex  as the giganotosaurus is said to be  quite a bit larger director colin  trevorrow compares the animal newcomer  with the joker that wants to see the  world burn at the very least that sounds  like some action-packed encounters  between the protagonists and the new  dinosaur especially since many fans are  looking forward to seeing a real-life  dinosaur and not an 