ity are  presented also involve our co-stars  america ferreira simulio and kate  mckinnon we will keep you posted on  further news although an official  release date is not yet known a release  in 2023 seems realistic  this week we would like to suggest you  to watch our news original on the  upcoming thor love and thunder where you  can get all the latest news on the mcu  movie after that you will definitely be  up to date even without a trailer  [Music]  foreign  [Music]

